WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.810
It was only a small wish...

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.820
To have quiet, uneventful days...

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.280
To have every day come one
after the other in peace...

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.990
I've never desired anything.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.490
I don't want power or
anything like that...

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:24.250
I just wish for you all
to stay by my side.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.380
That way, I can protect you...

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:33.680
There are times when our feelings might
have missed each other, but even so...

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:39.390
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:42.140
Welcome to the Mikuniya Supermarket!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:48.270
To warm you up during this cold winter,
we're having a sale on hot pot ingredients!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:52.060
We have the sale items gathered
together in each department.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.980
In the meat department,
we have special bargains on pork.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:59.200
Pork is a healthy, nutritious option!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.950
Purchase now during this special
sale to save up to 50% off!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.540
Hurry while supplies last,
this limited-time offer ends soon!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:15.340
Now that I think about it, you guys
have hardly been home recently, huh?

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.720
Yes... umm... I wonder why...?

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.050
I don't mind, though.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:30.350
If everyone has something they want
to go out and do, that's fine with me...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.480
Hayate-chan.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.690
After all, I was alone to begin with.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.530
Hayate-chan, don't worry!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:46.410
Everyone's busy at the moment, but...
umm... I'm sure soon, everyone will...

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.410
I see! If you say so, Shamal,
then it must be true.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.420
Suzuka-chan's coming over tonight, too.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.920
Do you think this'll be
enough meat for everyone?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:03:59.510
I think so.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.640
It's pretty cold outside, so a nice hot pot
would be good tonight, don't you think?

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:05.390
Yes.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.860
I hope everyone's not too cold...

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:28.160
It Was a Small Wish.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.880
A reinforced capture barrier, huh?

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.920
Vita and Zafira have been trapped inside?

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.050
Please choose your action.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:49.180
Laevatein, is your master the type of
knight who'd retreat at a time like this?

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.220
No.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:56.150
That's right, Laevatein. That is how
I've continued to fight to this day.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:10.740
We haven't come to fight you.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.910
First, let us hear why...

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.670
...you want to complete the Book of Darkness!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:19.590
You know, we have a saying in Belka.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.550
"Emissaries of peace don't carry spears."

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:32.810
Only a moron says they just want to
talk things out while carrying a weapon!

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.600
That means you, idiot!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:40.610
Says the girl who came at me
swinging without warning?!

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.740
And that's not actually a saying.
It's the punchline to a joke.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:45.860
Shut up!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.360
Who cares about the minor details?

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.210
Signum!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.520
Yuuno-kun! Chrono-kun! Don't interfere!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:17.770
I'm going to fight her one-on-one!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.230
Is she serious?

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.230
Yeah.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:23.820
<i>Arf.</i>

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.400
<i>The same goes for me.</i>

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:31.620
<i>I'll be fighting her.</i>

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:36.290
Yeah. It just so happens that I have
something to say to that punk up there, too.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:46.710
<i>Yuuno, in that case, this might
work out perfectly for us.</i>

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:50.180
<i>You and I should split up and search
for the Book of Darkness's master.</i>

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.680
<i>The Book of Darkness's master?</i>

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.800
<i>These three here don't have it with them.</i>

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:58.560
<i>There's most likely one more of them,
their master has to be somewhere nearby.</i>

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.810
<i>I'll look outside the barrier.
You explore the inside.</i>

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.440
<i>Alright.</i>

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.430
Master.

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.780
Please call me to "Cartridge Load."

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:09.990
Yeah.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.490
Raising Heart!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.500
Cartridge Load!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.410
Load Cartridge.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.630
Sir?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.590
Me too, right?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.140
Bardiche, Cartridge Load!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.100
Load Cartridge.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.820
So you've upgraded
your devices, huh?

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.320
Be careful, Vita.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.080
You don't have to tell me that!

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.050
So you <i>are</i> fighting after all!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:19.310
If I win, tell me why you're
doing all this, okay?!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:22.890
If you think you have a chance,
you're welcome to try!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.440
Schwalbefliegen.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:28.900
Accel Fin.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.200
Eisen!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.990
Explosion.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.290
Raketenform.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.250
Protection Powered.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:58.800
It's hard!

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:00.850
You're right...

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.890
Barrier Burst.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.400
Let's shoot it, Accel Shooter.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.910
Accel Shooter!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.950
Shoot!

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.250
Control, please.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:38.260
Are you an idiot? There's no way you can
control every single one of these shots!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.390
It can be done, as for my master.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:05.370
You promised if I win, you'll tell
me why you're doing all this!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.120
Accel...

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.550
Panzerhindernis.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.630
...Shoot!

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:31.230
You...!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:11:02.300
Plasma Lancer.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:04.930
Fire!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:13.770
Turn!

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:26.370
Laevatein!

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.870
(Storm Wave)
Sturmwelle.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.870
Blitz Rush.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.630
Burning Form.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:49.430
(Snake Form)
Schlangenform.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.290
You're strong, Testarossa.

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:18.090
(Sword Form)
Schwertform.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.340
And you too, Bardiche.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:23.220
Thank you.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:26.850
You and Laevatein are strong as well... Signum.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:28.850
Thank you.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:32.060
If I didn't have a goal I must achieve...

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.900
then my soul would have
danced with joy from this battle.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:38.020
But for my comrades and my master,
I can no longer be that way.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:43.570
I don't have the confidence to say
that I'll finish this without killing you.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:47.320
Can you forgive my immaturity?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:49.700
That won't be necessary.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.040
I will be the one to win, after all.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:38.290
Tough bastard!
Are you a familiar as well?!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:42.340
In Belka, we don't call the beasts
that serve their masters "familiars!"

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.380
We call them their fangs and shields!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.510
We're guardian beasts!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:51.010
That's the same... damn thing!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.480
<i>Things aren't looking too good right now...</i>

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:06.490
<i>I don't think Signum and Vita will
lose, but... we should withdraw.</i>

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.490
<i>Shamal, can you do anything?</i>

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:13.240
<i>I'd like to, but the Bureau's mages are
maintaining the barrier from the outside.</i>

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.450
<i>I can't destroy it with my magic alone.</i>

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:19.750
<i>I'll at least need the power of Signum's Falken,
or one of Vita's Gigant attacks...</i>

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.840
<i>They both have their hands full right now.</i>

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.960
<i>It can't be helped.
You'll have to use it.</i>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.670
<i>I know, but...</i>

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.510
<i>Shamal. What's wrong? Shamal!</i>

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:35.970
You're under arrest for suspicion of using
the Lost Logia we've been searching for.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.940
Alright! Chrono-kun, good job!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:46.190
If you don't resist, you'll be granted
the chance to plead in your own defense.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.650
If you consent to these conditions,
drop your weapons.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.790
Another ally...?

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.420
Amy! What was that just now?

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:10.720
I-I don't know! I'm not picking up
anything on my scanner!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.300
Why?! How is this happening?

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.270
Who are...?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.180
Use it.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:22.020
Use the power of the Book of
Darkness and destroy the barrier.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.150
But that would...!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.820
You can always refill the
pages you've used later on.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.280
It'll be too late if your
comrades are defeated now.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:42.920
<i>Everyone, I'm going to release a powerful
spell against the barrier and destroy it!</i>

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.920
<i>Be careful to dodge the shot and retreat!</i>

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.340
<i>Got it!</i>

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.430
Who are you?!
One of their allies?!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:58.680
Answer me!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.480
Book of Darkness...

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.520
your guardian, Shamal, orders you now,

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:11.030
release your power to crush
our enemies, here and now!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.760
Don't move just yet!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:40.720
Wait for the right moment. You'll soon
understand why that's the wisest decision.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:42.020
What?!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:50.980
Fire! Annihilation Lightning!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.070
As it is written.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.460
This is bad...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.830
Steel Defense!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:17.590
Sorry, Testarossa. We'll have to
save this battle for another time.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:18.970
Signum!

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.480
I'm the Wolkenritter's
Knight of the Iron Hammer, Vita.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:24.560
What's your name?

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:26.810
Nanoha.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.060
Takamachi Nanoha!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.820
Takamachi Nanu... Nan...

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.570
Damn it, that's hard to say!

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.070
She snapped at me?!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:38.410
Anyway, we'll finish this later!
Next time, I'll kill you!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.570
Definitely!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.490
Umm... Vita-chan?!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:47.210
Go protect your allies.
A direct hit would be lethal!

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:50.380
Y-Yeah.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:58.930
Situation report!

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.600
An explosion of magical power...

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.640
There's no physical damage,

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.600
but the search scanner and radar
have been completely jammed!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:16.780
<i>Nanoha, Fate, Arf, are you all right?!</i>

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.030
Y-Yeah...

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.160
Thank you, Yuuno-kun... Arf-san.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.790
C'mere, c'mere.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.300
Suzuka-chan, your kittens are so friendly!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:49.600
And I'm sorry about coming
over out of the blue like this.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:52.060
Not at all, it's totally fine!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.980
Rather, I'm glad you came over.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:56.990
I'll get it for you.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.490
Hello? It's me, Shamal...

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:04.990
Hayate-chan, I'm really, really sorry!

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.250
I thought things would finish quickly,

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:09.710
but it was difficult for me
to get everyone, so...

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.920
it took some time, and...

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.250
Yes... I accidentally left
my cell phone behind...

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.550
Yes, I'm back now...

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:23.010
Yes. Yes, everyone's with me.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.260
And, umm... how can I apologize for this?

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:28.930
Ah, thank goodness.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.970
I'm not mad at all.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:35.520
I'm fine. You really
don't need to apologize.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:40.110
Yeah... it was really lonely having
hot pot alone with just Suzuka-chan,

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.740
so she invited me over to her house.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.990
Yeah. That's all.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.950
I ate here at Suzuka-chan's.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.080
I cut up the ingredients and
put them in a pot in the fridge,

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.960
as well as the broth for the hot pot,
so it shouldn't take long to make it.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:57.340
Eat it with everyone, okay?

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.510
Yes...

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.220
I'm truly sorry...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.220
Yes.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.220
Here's Vita, then.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:07.930
Hayate? Hello?

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:25.280
We left her feeling sad...

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.490
Yeah...

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:31.250
But that aside, who was
that man who saved you?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.250
I don't know...

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:37.130
He doesn't seem like an enemy
we'll have to fight, at least...

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:41.800
And now the Administrative Bureau will
probably be taking this even more seriously.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.430
With that attack, we lost a
decent number of pages, too...

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.890
But we don't have much time.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:50.470
Yes...

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:55.690
We have to hurry and make Master
Hayate into the true owner of the Book.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:56.940
Yes...

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.780
Signum? Hayate said she
wants to talk to you.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:01.440
Got it.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.950
Hello, it's Signum.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.410
The Cartridge System is difficult to handle.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:21.170
Normally, it's not something you'd install
into delicate Intelligent Devices like yours.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:23.550
There's a big risk of their cores getting damaged,

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.430
and I told them how
dangerous it was, but...

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.090
they wanted it no matter what.

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.430
They must've been
pretty frustrated, huh?

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:34.180
About being unable to completely
protect their masters...

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.690
or being unable to live up
to their masters' trust...

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.190
Thank you, Raising Heart...

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.070
All right.

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:45.700
Bardiche...

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:47.700
Yes, sir.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:49.950
Each of them has their own three modes.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.990
Raising Heart has Accel Mode,
for medium-range shooting,

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.370
and Buster Mode for bombardment.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:56.710
And finally, there's
Full Drive Excelion Mode.

00:21:56.710 --> 00:22:00.170
Bardiche has the all-purpose
Assault Mode and Haken Form.

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.460
Finally, its Full Drive is the Zanber Form.

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.050
It's risky,

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:06.880
so don't use Full Drive mode
when you don't have to.

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:08.470
Especially you, Nanoha-chan.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:09.970
Yes?!

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:14.980
Until Raising Heart's framework is
reinforced, don't use Excelion Mode, okay?

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:16.480
Okay.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:26.110
The problem lies in what their goal is.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:27.320
Yes.

00:22:27.320 --> 00:22:28.820
I just can't figure it out.

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:35.120
I also feel like they actually want to
complete the Book of Darkness themselves.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.830
Is that supposed to be strange?

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:40.880
Isn't this Book of Darkness
just like the Jewel Seeds,

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:44.340
where someone gathers them
if they want a ton of power?

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:51.340
In that case, I don't think it's all
that weird to want it for its power...

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:56.890
First of all, the power of the
Book of Darkness, unlike the Jewel Seeds,

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:59.100
isn't something you can control.

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:03.730
Before and after its completion,
it can only be used for pure destruction.

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:08.240
At least, there's no record of it being
used for anything else in the past.

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:09.860
I see...

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:12.120
And one more thing.

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:14.620
Those knights...

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:17.080
They care for nothing except
guarding the Book of Darkness.

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.830
They're neither human nor familiar.

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:26.050
They're false beings spawned by the Book
of Darkness through magical technology.

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:29.380
They only act upon
their master's orders.

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.640
That's all they were supposed
to be programmed to do.

00:25:09.520 --> 00:25:12.690
This situation just keeps getting
more and more complicated!

00:25:12.690 --> 00:25:15.860
Artificial lives... Predetermined fates...

